Key design decisions baked in: `data-testid` on every control (your Playwright selectors survive restyles), `autocomplete="cc-*"` tokens (native autofill + your E2E tooling), custom validation (no native bubbles), and a standalone preview mode — opened from disk it simulates submit; served behind your app it POSTs to ENDPOINT. No processor names anywhere; the one copy line "Sandbox environment — test cards only." is a placeholder, strip it if you want.

